  "title": "Quebec City Sugar Pie with Thick Cream",
  "description": "This version is the regional specialty at its finest. This lovely brown-sugar-and-egg mixture sets like pumpkin pie! Serve in a pool of thick cream, which is the perfect complement to the rich, sweet dessert.",
  "authors": [
    "CTREYNARD"
